  "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: hateful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a man in a police uniform with arms crossed, juxtaposed with text that reads 'no pity sex?' and 'i am going to shoot an unarmed black citizen.' This combination is a hateful meme that directly targets Black individuals by invoking a racist stereotype associating them with criminality and violence, while also using the phrase 'no pity sex?' to imply hypersexualization. The meme is designed to provoke and spread harmful racial stereotypes, portraying Black people as inherently dangerous and deserving of lethal force, which constitutes a direct hateful attack based on race. The visual of the police officer reinforces the stereotype that law enforcement is complicit in or representative of this violence against Black citizens. The overall intent is to normalize or justify racialized violence against Black people through the use of dehumanizing and dangerous tropes.",
